{"recordId":"emperor_宋神宗_284189155","name":"宋神宗","type":"emperor","dynasty":"北宋","title":"熙豐圖強","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"宋神宗","pageId":17142,"revisionId":94217217,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-06T11:04:57Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%8B%E7%A5%9E%E5%AE%97","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94217217","wikidataId":"Q7483","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"《宋史·神宗本紀》","url":"http://www.guoxue123.com/shibu/0101/00songs/015.htm","type":"citation-template","template":"Cite web","author":"","publisher":"","date":"","isbn":"","locator":"citation template"},{"citationTitle":"宋会要辑稿·礼五八·历代帝谥","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"韓非子","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"上仁宗皇帝言事書","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"邵氏聞見錄‧卷第五","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"续资治通鉴长编·卷五百二十·元符三年","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋史·神宗本紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋会要辑稿","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"東都事略","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"续资治通鉴长编","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"宋论","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"神宗一","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"續資治通鑑長編/卷520","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E7%BA%8C%E8%B3%87%E6%B2%BB%E9%80%9A%E9%91%91%E9%95%B7%E7%B7%A8%2F%E5%8D%B7520","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:03.263Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:suishu","source:mingshi","source:qingshigao"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:suishu-03cb5bfff7dc6bc3","query":"宋神宗","count":1,"offset":10092,"excerpt":"『御諱州』。」此處的「御諱州」，唐書三八地理志作「旭州」。宋人刊元和志時避趙頊(宋神宗)嫌名改(頊、旭，音近)。因此，這裏的「洮州」也可能是宋人改的。〕辛未，高麗遣使來朝。壬申，以尚書右僕射趙煚兼內史令。丁丑，以滕王瓚為雍州牧。己卯，衞王爽破突厥","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-d4b62eec1ac39e01","query":"宋神宗","count":1,"offset":4103,"excerpt":"來，莫能明其始祖所自出，當時所謂禘祭，不過祫已祧之祖而祭之，乃古之大祫，非禘也。宋神宗嘗曰： 『禘者，所以審諦祖之所自出。』是則莫知祖之所自出，禘禮不可行也。今國家追尊四廟，而始祖所自出者未有所考，則禘難遽行。」太祖是其議。弘治元年，定每歲暮奉祧","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-b599853e97b106ea","query":"宋神宗","count":1,"offset":1780,"excerpt":"一官。部臣言：「成章孝行，兩地已勘實，登之朝覲憲綱，瑉言非謬。昔朱壽昌棄官尋母，宋神宗詔令就官。今所司知而不能薦，臣等又拘例而不請旌，真有愧於古誼。請量授成章國子學錄，賜瑉花紅羊酒。」制曰：「可。」\n\n謝用，字希中，祁門人。父永貞。生母馬氏方妊，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-b857a8837d8caa1f","query":"宋神宗","count":1,"offset":5029,"excerpt":"出，而太廟中無嚳位，故祫祭不及。至禘祭乃設嚳位，以稷配焉。行於後代，不能盡合。故宋神宗罷禘禮。明洪武初或請舉行，眾議不果。嘉靖中，乃立虛位，祀皇初祖帝，以太祖配，事涉不經，禮亦旋罷。國家初定鼎，追上四祖尊稱，立廟崇祀，自肇祖始。太祖功德隆盛，當為","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:qingshigao-20987194740f4106","query":"宋神宗","count":1,"offset":15264,"excerpt":"，固由東北入海。自漢王莽時河徙千乘入海，而禹之故道失。歷東漢迄隋、唐，從無變異。宋神宗時，河分南北兩派並行，北派由北清河入海。即今大清河。至元至元間，會通河成，懼河北行礙運，而北流塞。歷今五六百年，河屢北決，無不挽之使南。說者謂河一入運，必挾泥沙","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:suishu-03cb5bfff7dc6bc3","bookId